# AI Harmonizer Project Rules

## Project Overview
This is a TypeScript/React music harmonization app that analyzes MIDI files and generates chord progressions.

## Stack
- Frontend: React + TypeScript + Vite
- Backend: Node.js/Express (server/index.ts)
- Styling: Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui components

## Coding Rules
- Always use TypeScript, never plain JavaScript
- Follow existing naming conventions in the codebase
- Keep components in client/src/components/
- Keep business logic in client/src/lib/
- Run `npm run build` to verify no TypeScript errors before finishing any task

## When completing tasks
1. Read the relevant files first to understand context
2. Make changes
3. Always check for TypeScript errors when done
4. Create a clear git commit message describing what was changed
